r the jars were created  to bring the bodies of warrior who fell  in the ritual combat of the coliseums to  the minor herb trees in order to provide  nourishment to the new tree sprouts and  recycle them into grace for the rest of  the citizens of the lands between a  method of cycling life under queen  merica the eternal like i said though  this is just one of a few different  theories of how the living jars came to  be all of which are pretty speculative  so for the time being i digress back on  topic though even if the soul jars were  potentially created as a way to house  the dead and water the earth trees why  are they being poached for their  materials is business really just that  good right now well i'm inclined to say  no seeing as merchants that we can find  throughout the lands between haven't  seen a customer in ages on the other  hand ages ago there was this little war  called the shattering in the war several  things which were previously outlawed or  shunned were brought into focus and  exploited for the purposes of war such  as the art of making weaponized perfume  also known as aromatics the war led to a  bunch of perfumers being drafted into  combat and therefore made this practice  a widely exploited tactic and led to the  rise and demand of certain types of  perfumes such as the spark and iron jar  aromatics the iron jar aromatic is a bit  unique because not only does it raise a  user's poise while rendering them more  vulnerable to lightning but just like  the name implies it is made through use  of shards of living jars which means  that jars have to be killed and  harvested in order for these to be made  it says write in the description that  perfumers are plainly in league with jar  poachers this means that essentially  jars became hunted for their bodies as a  result of the shattering war and as a  result of being hunted most of the soul  jars then decided that they would make  use of the warrior bodies within them  and become warriors thems